# Building the professional-style home lab

You don't need to jump straight into enterprise servers.

A better path is:

```text
STAGE 1
Desktop / Mini Homelab

       ↓

STAGE 2
Rack + Network + NAS

       ↓

STAGE 3
Virtualisation Cluster

       ↓

STAGE 4
Dedicated GPU Compute

       ↓

STAGE 5
Distributed AI Lab
```

A compact rack can already accommodate mini PCs, Raspberry Pis, networking, NAS/storage and dedicated monitoring hardware; modern homelab builds often use exactly that modular layout. 

