# Stage 2 — networking

Your eventual target should be:

**2.5 GbE everywhere important → 10 GbE backbone.**

That matters once large models and datasets start moving between systems.

A single 40 GB model transferred across ordinary 1 GbE networking gets annoying very quickly.

Ideal topology:

```text
Internet
   │
Firewall
